      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-body-sm text-muted list-disc pl-5">
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/contracted-revenue-key-to-california-bess-financing-as-merchant-market-weakens-esvolta-ceo-explains/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contracted revenue key to California BESS financing as merchant market weakens, esVolta CEO explains — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/iberian-bess-market-needs-more-flexibility-clearer-frameworks-and-faster-permitting/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Iberian BESS market needs more flexibility, clearer frameworks and faster permitting — Energy Storage News</a></li>
