        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/what-makes-a-german-bess-project-bankable-lenders-owners-weigh-in-at-energy-storage-summit-germany/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">What makes a German BESS project bankable? Lenders, owners weigh in at Energy Storage Summit Germany — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/competitive-tco-detailed-specs-strong-local-presence-key-bess-supplier-success-germany-rwe-says/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Competitive TCO, detailed specs and strong local presence key for BESS supplier success in Germany, RWE says — Energy Storage News</a></li>
