        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/moroccos-first-large-scale-lfp-battery-storage-system-prepares-for-action/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Morocco’s first large-scale LFP battery storage system prepares for action — Energy Storage News</a></li>
